  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Search and filter clients to quickly locate records in Capium 365\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 22 Jul, 2025 at 10:12 AM\n\n\t\tSearch and filter clients\n\nWithin the Capium 365 Manage dashboard, you can efficiently locate clients using the search bar, which allows searches by client ID, name, contact name, and more.\n\nAdditionally, the dashboard provides robust filtering options to help refine your view:\n\n365 Status Filters:\n\nAll 365 Status\nInvite\nActive\nResend Invitation\nImported\nReferred\n\nGeneral Status Filters:\n\nAll Status\nActive\nInactive\n\nThese tools enable streamlined navigation and management of your client base within Capium 365.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
